        "heading": "Wholesale pricing sheet",
        "intro": "BPM Natural Deodorant is available for wholesale across Canada, in two scent options, Bergamot + Lime and Unscented. Retailers receive a 50% margin at MSRP, with a 12 unit single scent case pack and a one case per scent minimum on opening orders. Orders of two cases or more ship free, and every new account receives one free tester per variety on their first order. Full pricing and order terms are outlined below."
